content.text:
In v4, use the `@variant` directive with a breakpoint name inside your CSS rule:

```css
.my-element {
  --my-var: 1rem;

  @variant md {
    --my-var: 2rem;
  }
}
```

This compiles to a `@media (width >= 48rem)` block wrapping the declaration.

Source: `src/docs/adding-custom-styles.mdx` — "Using custom CSS › Using variants" (lines 299–400).

